      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUKE.\nThere rest.\nYour partner, as I hear, must die tomorrow,\nAnd I am going with instruction to him.\nGrace go with you! Benedicite!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
