      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIET.\nMust die tomorrow? O, injurious love\nThat respites me a life, whose very comfort\nIs still a dying horror!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
